@startuml state_biblerevision
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam BackgroundColor white
[*] --> Draft : AddBibleEntryRevision (Writer)
Draft --> ConceptSubmitted : Artist uploads concept
ConceptSubmitted --> WriterEndorsed : Writer endorses
ConceptSubmitted --> ReworkRequired : Writer requests rework
ReworkRequired --> ConceptSubmitted : Artist resubmits
WriterEndorsed --> CanonLocked : LockBibleEntryRevision (Producer)
CanonLocked --> [*]
@enduml
